        "id": "0c05a7e1-725b-4dc7-be85-67d5af5a9cef",
        "content": "<speak>If you received a letter from the Consumer Use Tax Section, press one. For information regarding Use Tax paid to California or form C D T eff eh one-eleven, Use Tax Clearance, press two. For general Sales and Use Tax questions or questions not specific to a vehicle, vessel or aircraft, press three and you will be connected to our Customer Service Center. If you received a notice of billing or delinquency or wish to discuss payment plans, liens or levies, press four. If you are calling regarding items that were imported or shipped to you from another country, press five. To repeat these options, press eight.</speak>",
